cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bovidaeta, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bovidaeta: a common data format for dairy cattle data"
abstract: >-
  bovidaeta is a data format for dairy cattle data (herds, cows and a
  timeline of events per cow), with Python data models, SQLite and Delta
  Lake storage, and a loader that reads both.
